### Tested versions

Tested PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824 and got this, but that was merged into master shortly after. v4.7.beta.custom_build [81ade7641]

### System information

Godot v4.7.beta (81ade7641) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)

### Issue description

When trying to use multithreaded resource loading to load level scenes for my retro FPS, I was running into crashes, reported here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111202  This PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824 now results in the game deadlocking.

I posted the info here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111202#issuecomment-4393743900

But I think it got lost since the issue was closed, so I'm creating a new issue.

Copy/pasting the info:


